{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Synchronize the on-change lifecycle assertion**\n\nThe export scheduler intentionally retains only the latest pending snapshot. These three trivial steps can finish before the worker consumes a RUNNING record, leaving only the terminal record and making this assertion race-dependent. Coordinate the handler with a recording exporter/event or force a suspension and drain before terminal completion.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7uC9Eb","finding_digest":"9acd69646ca29f793d708c3a3c64604b1b5f2a38ac81537b2748f802aee02d1c","finding_id":"arf_v1_tlgwszdmukpxsplqrq5dyzdajm","finding_key":"insight/tests/e2e/exporters_lifecycle_int_test.py::test_exporters_receive_records_through_the_plugin_lifecycle::scheduler-coalescing-race","identity_key":"insight/tests/e2e/exporters_lifecycle_int_test.py::test_exporters_receive_records_through_the_plugin_lifecycle::scheduler-coalescing-race","line":98,"observation_digest":"23e42c94df3ea22dcadff246fdf77a8e8ffe0c4cb8d8750fee804fec7f8b6b05","observation_id":"aro_v1_epsczfg7h2rc3sw76jdp3532r2","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/tests/e2e/exporters_lifecycle_int_test.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:53Z","review_id":"arr_v1_au5e3inkypj77dyafq5zyn566k","reviewed_base_sha":"8742ad9c9535e1de042963963c6b439f656894ce","reviewed_head_sha":"7f24921722e226045a5f548585ea7fbad6134fcf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":98,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_k7lonmh2vqo4xr2jyivtdhqlbh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:53Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
